          "type": "FGeometryParticleHandle*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Context",
          "type": "FCollisionContext&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "FParticlePairMidPhase*",
      "docs": "Return a midphase for a particle pair.\nThis wil create a new midphase if the particle pairs were not recently overlapping, or return an\nexisting one if they were.\n@note Nothing outside of thie allocator should hold a pointer to the midphase, or any constraints\nit creates for more than the duration of the tick. Except the IslandManager :|"
    },
